# Projects

Purpose:
  Multi-project and formalized prompt registry.
  Contains project-specific formalized content such as prompts
  that have been analyzed and approved for execution.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @prompts/INDEX.sdd

Rules:
  [PRJ1] Each project MUST have its own subdirectory.
  [PRJ2] Formalized prompts MUST live in projects/prompts/.
  [PRJ3] Project state MUST be tracked in project/.

Navigation:
  Prompts: @prompts/INDEX.sdd
  ProjectModel: @../project/INDEX.sdd

State: +
